OL,3,AMany hydrants lacking flow needed for
OL,4,Afirefighting needs, fire chiefs say
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire hydrants in the UK often do not
OL,7,Fprovide enough water flow for
OL,8,Ffirefighting, fire chiefs have warned.
OL,10,FA report published by the National Fire
OL,11,FChiefs Council (NFCC) claims that
OL,12,Finadequate water supplies across the UK
OL,13,Fare impacting fire crews' "ability to
OL,14,Frespond effectively" and putting the
OL,15,Fpublic at risk.
OL,17,FIt carried out a survey of UK fire
OL,18,Fservices which suggested that 81% have
OL,19,Fhad to change their emergency response
OL,20,Fplans due to concerns over adequate
OL,21,Fwater supplies.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
